 playbook was formatted to ensure no line exceeds 80 characters, especially within the `when` clause and `vars` section.\n- The logic and task structure were preserved as requested, maintaining the original functionality and identifiers.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-24T03:40:55.552768164Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10084148888, 'load_duration': 66833387, 'prompt_eval_count': 1321, 'prompt_eval_duration': 18487400, 'eval_count': 510, 'eval_duration': 9997089909, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--4adcfa37-7559-49aa-8345-6bdbdddfbebc-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1321, 'output_tokens': 510, 'total_tokens': 1831}
