it for remaining nodes to be ready - with CNI\n  ansible.builtin.wait_for:\n    timeout: 600\n  retries: 5\n  delay: 10\n  when: ansible_hostname == groups[\'servers\'][0] or (groups[\'servers\'] | length > 1 and ansible_hostname == groups[\'servers\'][1])\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-24T04:26:47.116381789Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10350636729, 'load_duration': 63128052, 'prompt_eval_count': 745, 'prompt_eval_duration': 290589396, 'eval_count': 638, 'eval_duration': 9994711197, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--684362f2-5618-4cb8-ac90-136ea2028ac8-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 745, 'output_tokens': 638, 'total_tokens': 1383}
